  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 802.04 “Contaminant” or “contamination” means “contaminant” or “contamination” as defined in RSA 147-F:3, III, as reprinted in Appendix B. For the purpose of the brown",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 802.04 “Contaminant” or “contamination” means “contaminant” or “contamination” as defined in RSA 147-F:3, III, as reprinted in Appendix B. For the purpose of the brownfields program established in RSA 147-F, the term excludes materials contained in building products located in or on a building, such as lead paint or asbestos insulation.\n\nSource. #8809, eff 1-26-07; ss by #10833, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14421, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or800.html"
